# Tainted Remedy replaces only an opponent's gain of life. Bot1 exiles Bot2's Ornithopter with Swords to Plowshares: Bot2
# "gains life equal to its power", 0, which is no life gain event (CR 119.10), so there is nothing to replace and Bot2
# loses nothing (20). Bot1's own Lightning Helix then gains Bot1 3 life, untouched: Bot1 is not its own opponent
# (20 -> 23), and Bot2 takes the 3 damage (20 -> 17).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Sol Ring
Mox Jet
Tainted Remedy
Plains
Swords to Plowshares
Mountain
Lightning Helix
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

