Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tainted Remedy.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
